WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:05.004
First, the partitions: commercial
AWS in its Health region,

3
00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:09.850
and GovCloud in its single West
region, each with its own ARN prefix.

4
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:14.700
Then, after collecting the fixtures,
read each notice's action basis.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:20.022
The EC2 instance retirement and the
security notification say provider,

6
00:00:20.022 --> 00:00:23.163
actionability action
required: AWS said so.

7
00:00:23.163 --> 00:00:25.940
The Lambda planned
lifecycle event says rule:

8
00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:30.251
a scheduled change whose event type
names a retirement, due at its start.

9
00:00:30.251 --> 00:00:33.375
Maintenance and the closed
incident need no action.

10
00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:38.230
It's the same split our Azure retirement
showed: who said it is always written down.
